
@host = http://localhost:5678/
@cap_service_hist = http://localhost:4004/

@N8N_API_KEY = {{$dotenv N8N_API_KEY}}

@basic_auth = n8n_wf_user:n8n_wf_user

### Trigger Webhook with API Key (Had to set the webhook to use header auth and use  header X-N8N-API-KEY in order to use cap-n8n plugin)
POST {{host}}webhook-test/submitClaimReview HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Basic {{basic_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claim_id": "2000000003",
  "description": "Excessive sediment and haze in beer",
  "type": "Quality Claim",
  "primary_defect_code_id": "00001",
  "secondary_defects": [
    {
      "defect_code_name": "Discolouration"
    },
    {
      "defect_code_name": "Poor Carbonation"
    }
  ],
  "evidence_attachments": [
    {
      "ID": "d4d3af50-a1b3-41de-9772-d1ee4119ccb2",
      "name": "ColaCanCrushed.jpeg",
      "contentType": "image/jpeg",
      "type_id": "DAMAGE",
      "type": "Evidence of Damage"
    }
  ]
}
    

### Get Workflow Details via REST API
GET {{host}}api/v1/workflows/ilkNoziH22zXfqr0 HTTP/1.1
X-N8N-API-KEY: {{N8N_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Call updateAgentAssessment Bound Action
POST {{cap_service_hist}}app/claim/Claims(ID='3b241101-e2bb-4255-8caf-4136c566a980',IsActiveEntity=true)/updateAgentAssessment HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Basic {{basic_auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outcome": 85,
  "report": "Claim assessment completed by agent"
}
